<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n114692" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρηστ-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χράομαι</span>) of persons, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>knowing how to use, understanding the use of</i> a thing, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ὑπαρχόντων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Oec.</u>
					1344b26
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεσποτικὴ ἐπιστήμη ἡ χ. δούλων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1255b31
				</span></i>
			: abs., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δύναμις χ.,</span> opp.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπηρετική,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>in Prm.</u>
				p.735
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>: also c. dat. (like the Verb), <i><span class="en">
				M.Ant.
				7.55
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of things,
				<i>useful, serviceable,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σώματος ἕξις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
				</span></i>
			
			
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Cat.Ma.</u>
				1
			</span></i>: 
				Sup.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλι -ώτατον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.32e
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				80b
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ώτερον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>Epict.</u>
					2.9.19
				</span></i>
			.</div>
